{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "46b66633-ecfb-81b5-bf06-e4c57ce4ba1f",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T10:31:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linh Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:27:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:27:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I am calling because I need a dumpster in front of my rental house, on the street, and I want to know what permit I need for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:27:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. So you're putting a dumpster on the street, not in a driveway or on your own property. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:27:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, on the street. No way I can put it in the driveway, it is too narrow, the truck does not fit. So it has to be in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:27:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:27:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three eleven Admiral Kalbfus Road, in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:27:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three eleven Admiral Kalbfus. Thank you. And are you the owner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:28:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am the owner, yes. I am the landlord. The tenant moved out and I am redoing the kitchen and the bathroom, so there is a lot of old stuff to throw away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:28:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So that would be a street occupancy type of permit for the dumpster. Is the contractor ordering the dumpster, or are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:28:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am ordering. I do it myself, no contractor. I do a lot of the work by myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:28:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Then you'd be the one applying. Do you know which company you're using yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:28:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet, I am still calling around. Is that a problem? Do I need the company name for the permit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:28:43-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's usually helpful to have it, so I'd pick one before you come in. They can also tell you the size of the dumpster, and that matters for how much of the street it takes up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:28:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. That makes sense. And how long can the dumpster stay in front of the house? I think maybe two weeks, but I am not sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:29:07-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The length of time is set on the permit itself, so it depends on what you request and what's approved. For a typical cleanout, people ask for a week or two. If you think you'll need longer, tell us when you apply rather than leaving it out there past the date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:29:26-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, so I say how many days when I apply. Good. Because the kitchen, I do it slowly, you know, on the weekends. Maybe I need a little more time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:29:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then put the longer time on the application. It's easier than extending later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:29:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what documents I need to bring? Do I bring something for the house, or for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:29:50-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring a photo ID, and something showing you own the property if you have it handy, like a tax bill or a deed copy. Bring the dumpster company's name and the size, the dates you want, and a note of where exactly it'll sit on the street. If the company gives you paperwork, bring that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:30:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me write. Photo ID, tax bill or deed, company name and size, the dates, and where it sits. Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That covers it. Do you know if you'll be taking up any parking spaces, or is it just in front of your house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:30:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just in front of my house. There is no parking sign there, I think, but I am not sure. I can check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:30:37-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please look when you get there. If there are signs, mention it when you come in so we can tell you what's needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:30:46-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I look today. You know, I do the work myself because a neighbor taught me how to fix a leaky faucet last year, and after that I thought, why pay somebody for everything? [pause] Anyway, sorry, that is not your problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine. Good to be handy. So, for the application, you can come to the office in person. Are you able to come during the day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can come tomorrow morning. What time do you open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open in the morning, and the front desk can point you to the right counter. Just say it's for a street dumpster permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, street dumpster permit. Very good. Do I need an appointment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No appointment needed. Just come in with your documents and we'll go from there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Thank you so much, you were very clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:31:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye bye."
    }
  ],
